{"c":{"197172":["Akane Kinoshita","Female","b197172-MfY8D8sSMjHy.png","Akane is a college student who had just broken up with her ex-boyfriend. Mainly because of him falling in love with another female gamer he met in the game Forest Of Savior (FOS). She is also a player of the said game and is a part of the guild named [Chocolate Rabbit].",1846],"197173":["Akito Yamada","Male","b197173-t2KNplNgpQV6.png","Yamada is a high school student who is an intellectual and a good looking guy. He is not interested in romance but in playing games. He is a famous pro-gamer and receives money from sponsors. He mainly plays FPS (First Person Shooter) games.",2380],"199120":["Runa Sasaki","Female","b199120-cC3hg83DYcto.png","Runa is a middle high school student who usually dresses in Lolita Fashion. She is the younger sister of Eita Sasaki. She is also being mentored by Yamada during the weekends. She is also a player of the game Forest Of Savior (FOS) and a member of the guild [Chocolate Rabbit].",220],"199121":["Eita Sasaki","Male","b199121-8PgP309K6DkU.png","Sasaki is the older brother of Runa Sasaki. He is also Yamada-kun's senpai back in their hometown. His hobby is playing video games. He also plays the game Forest of Savior (FOS) and is also a member of the guild [Chocolate Rabbit].",464],"300521":["Momoko Maeda","Female","b300521-6fSVkgiIwyNX.png","",123],"300522":["Takezou Kamota","Male","b300522-m2eyMOpUOsr6.jpg","Takezo is an elderly man with a gentle and kind demeanor. Despite his age, he remains an active member of the Chocolate Rabbit Guild and contributes to its activities. He owns a strawberry farm.",129],"300523":["Yukari Tsubaki","Female","b300523-RRgXKilKngPF.jpg","",50],"302088":["Takuma Furukawa","Male","b302088-RFwfKVAkpXuM.png","Akane's ex-boyfriend.",1],"302089":["Eri","Female","b302089-D85KHdRf08mz.png","Takuma's current girlfriend.",1],"302593":["Biyooshi",null,"default.jpg","",1],"302594":["Esthetician",null,"default.jpg","",1],"302595":["Event Announcer"